68
00:02:16,305 --> 00:02:18,021
团队把已知区域遮住来验证，
The team hid known regions to validate it,

69
00:02:18,041 --> 00:02:19,507
预测和真实测量
and predictions matched real UV

70
00:02:19,527 --> 00:02:21,329
相差大约 10%。
measurements to within about 10%.

71
00:02:21,349 --> 00:02:24,173
整个过程做了十几个版本，花了好几天。
It took more than a dozen versions over several days.

72
00:02:24,193 --> 00:02:27,205
地图上每个像素都标了是实测还是预测，
Every pixel is labeled measured or predicted,

73
