96
00:03:09,726 --> 00:03:12,624
第五件，字节 Seed 团队给 DeepSeek
Fifth, ByteDance's Seed team has proposed a reason DeepSeek

97
00:03:12,644 --> 00:03:14,291
时好时坏，找了个原因。
can seem erratic on long inputs.

98
00:03:14,311 --> 00:03:17,598
论文 9 月底发在 arXiv 上，10 月 9 日
The paper went on arXiv in late September, and on October 9,

99
00:03:17,618 --> 00:03:19,440
